YODA
------------------------------------------
YODA is a small set of data analysis (specifically histogramming) classes being
developed by MCnet members as a lightweight common system for MC event
generator validation analyses, particularly as the core histogramming system in
Rivet.

Runtime requirements:
  bash-5.2.21-1
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libYODA-devel-2.1.4-1bl1
  libYODA0-2.1.4-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libyaml-cpp-devel-0.9.0-1bl2
  libyaml-cpp0.9-0.9.0-1bl2
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python312-3.12.12-1
  python312-YODA-2.1.4-1bl1
  python312-matplotlib-3.11.2-1
  python312-numpy-2.5.4-1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

