Canonical website:
  https://yoda.hepforge.org/

Canonical download:
  https://yoda.hepforge.org/downloads/YODA-2.1.4.tar.bz2

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack YODA-2.1.4-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./YODA-2.1.4-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/YODA-2.1.4-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/YODA-2.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libYODA0-2.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libYODA-devel-2.1.4-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-YODA-2.1.4-X.tar.xz

